      "source": "Use this type e.g. with drag and drop APIs or to create a [`fileExporter(isPresented:item:contentTypes:defaultFilename:onCompletion:onCancellation:)`](view/fileexporter(ispresented:item:contenttypes:defaultfilename:oncompletion:oncancellation:).md).",
